{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"function requireTextOnlyEmbeddingInput(\n   input, \n   provider, \n   model): string[];","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/utilities/embedding-input.ts#L53","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/utilities/embedding-input.ts:53"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Extract plain text inputs for a text-only embedding model, throwing a\nuniform error if any item carries an image. The per-model modality typing\nrejects these at compile time; this guard covers untyped/dynamic callers."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"input","children":[{"type":"text","value":"input"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"../type-aliases/EmbeddingInputItem.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"EmbeddingInputItem"}]},{"type":"text","value":"[]"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"provider","children":[{"type":"text","value":"provider"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"string"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"model","children":[{"type":"text","value":"model"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"string"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"string"},{"type":"text","value":"[]"}]}],"headings":[{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":2},{"id":"input","text":"input","level":3},{"id":"provider","text":"provider","level":3},{"id":"model","text":"model","level":3},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\nfunction requireTextOnlyEmbeddingInput(\n   input, \n   provider, \n   model): string[];\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/utilities/embedding-input.ts:53](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/utilities/embedding-input.ts#L53)\n\nExtract plain text inputs for a text-only embedding model, throwing a\nuniform error if any item carries an image. The per-model modality typing\nrejects these at compile time; this guard covers untyped/dynamic callers.\n\n## Parameters\n\n### input\n\n[`EmbeddingInputItem`](../type-aliases/EmbeddingInputItem.md)[]\n\n### provider\n\n`string`\n\n### model\n\n`string`\n\n## Returns\n\n`string`[]\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: requireTextOnlyEmbeddingInput\ntitle: requireTextOnlyEmbeddingInput\n---\n\n```ts\nfunction requireTextOnlyEmbeddingInput(\n   input, \n   provider, \n   model): string[];\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/utilities/embedding-input.ts:53](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/utilities/embedding-input.ts#L53)\n\nExtract plain text inputs for a text-only embedding model, throwing a\nuniform error if any item carries an image. The per-model modality typing\nrejects these at compile time; this guard covers untyped/dynamic callers.\n\n## Parameters\n\n### input\n\n[`EmbeddingInputItem`](../type-aliases/EmbeddingInputItem.md)[]\n\n### provider\n\n`string`\n\n### model\n\n`string`\n\n## Returns\n\n`string`[]\n"}
